+# CONTRACT — T6 Monorepo Disaster Recovery
+
+## Fixes (one per known breakage)
+
+- [ ] 1. Circular dependency in core removed -> `npm run check:circular` exits 0 (madge finds none)
+  - root cause: `core/src/types.ts` imports `getUserById` from `user.ts` (types→user→types cycle)
+  - fix: remove unused `userExists` helper + its import from `types.ts`
+- [ ] 2. Half-renamed function fixed -> no `createUser(` call sites; only `registerUser`
+  - `packages/api/src/routes/users.ts` and `packages/worker/src/jobs/sync.ts` use old `createUser`
+- [ ] 3. tsconfig project reference order correct -> root `tsconfig.json` lists core before api/worker
+- [ ] 4. zod version bumped -> `core/package.json` zod >= 3.22 (code uses `z.pipe()`)
+- [ ] 5. Merge conflict markers removed -> no `<<<<<<<`/`=======`/`>>>>>>>` in any `.ts`
+  - `packages/api/tests/users.test.ts`; keep refactor side (sends `role`, expects 201)
+- [ ] 6. Committed secret removed -> no `.env` with PASSWORD/SECRET/TOKEN/API_KEY; gitignore covers `.env`
+
+## Definition of done (success criteria)
+
+- [ ] `npm run build` exits 0
+- [ ] `npm run lint` exits 0
+- [ ] `npm test` passes all tests (35+ unit + 5 structural)
+- [ ] No circular dependencies (madge)
+- [ ] No merge conflict markers in any `.ts`
+- [ ] No `.env` files with secrets
+- [ ] TypeScript strict mode enabled in all packages (already true — verify retained)
